Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: linebreak complete_commands linebreak
    2        | linebreak

    3 complete_commands: complete_commands separator list
    4                  | list

    5 list: pipeline
    6     | list AND_IF linebreak pipeline
    7     | list OR_IF linebreak pipeline

    8 pipeline: command
    9         | pipeline PIPE linebreak command

   10 command: simple_command
   11        | subshell
   12        | subshell redirect_list

   13 subshell: OPAR compound_list CPAR

   14 compound_list: linebreak term
   15              | linebreak term separator

   16 term: term separator list
   17     | list

   18 simple_command: cmd_prefix cmd_word cmd_suffix
   19               | cmd_prefix cmd_word
   20               | cmd_prefix
   21               | cmd_name cmd_suffix
   22               | cmd_name

   23 cmd_name: WORD

   24 cmd_word: WORD

   25 cmd_prefix: io_redirect
   26           | cmd_prefix io_redirect

   27 cmd_suffix: io_redirect
   28           | cmd_suffix io_redirect
   29           | WORD
   30           | cmd_suffix WORD

   31 redirect_list: io_redirect
   32              | redirect_list io_redirect

   33 io_redirect: io_file
   34            | io_here

   35 io_file: LESS filename
   36        | GREAT filename
   37        | DGREAT filename

   38 filename: WORD

   39 io_here: DLESS here_end

   40 here_end: WORD

   41 separator: NEWLINE
   42          | separator NEWLINE

   43 linebreak: separator
   44          | ε


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    WORD (258) 23 24 29 30 38 40
    NEWLINE (259) 41 42
    PIPE (260) 9
    LESS (261) 35
    GREAT (262) 36
    DLESS (263) 39
    DGREAT (264) 37
    AND_IF (265) 6
    OR_IF (266) 7
    OPAR (267) 13
    CPAR (268) 13


